# Goal: Send a network command to the ESP32 fridge controller
# Field names have no underscores for MCP compatibility
string command      # open, close, or toggle
int32 waitms        # Wait after command in milliseconds (<=0 uses default)
int32 timeoutms     # Request timeout in milliseconds (<=0 uses default)
---
# Result
bool success
string message
---
# Feedback
string currentstatus
float32 progresspercentage
